    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21552" root="شبث" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَبُّوثٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَبَّاثٌ</span></b>  [so in the CK and in my
MS. copy of the K, but the latter is strangely
said in the TA to be with kesr,] sings. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَبَابِيثُ</span>,
which signifies The <i>flesh-hooks</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلَالِيب</span>) of the
fire. (K.)

